{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "1f2d8d95-f8c0-4b62-a321-7e0d8fe3e001",
    "name": "Vexxo Local",
    "description": "Coleccion unica para probar Vexxo en local contra http://127.0.0.1:8000.\n\nOrden recomendado:\n1. Auth -> Register\n2. Auth -> Login\n3. Identity -> Me\n4. Accounts -> Create Account\n5. Transactions -> Create Transaction\n6. Luego Payments, Alerts, Notifications y Realtime\n\nVariables importantes:\n- access_token y refresh_token se llenan automatico tras Login\n- account_id, transaction_id, inference_request_id, alert_id, notification_id y payment_intent_id se llenan con requests helper\n- internal_token solo aplica para endpoints internos",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000" },
    { "key": "email", "value": "prueba@example.com" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "Secret12345!" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "account_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "transaction_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "inference_request_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "alert_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "notification_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "payment_intent_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "internal_token", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Start Here",
      "description": "Lee esta carpeta primero. No son requests funcionales; es la guia rapida para usar la coleccion.\n\nFlujo minimo:\n- Register\n- Login\n- Me\n- Create Account\n- Create Transaction\n\nSi ya tienes usuario, puedes saltarte Register y correr Login.",
      "item": []
    },
    {
      "name": "01 - Auth",
      "description": "Bloque de autenticacion. Login guarda access_token y refresh_token automaticamente en variables de coleccion.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "description": "Crea un usuario nuevo. Si el correo ya existe, Postman devolvera error y puedes seguir directamente con Login.",
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"full_name\": \"Usuario Prueba\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"password2\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"preferred_currency\": \"COP\",\n  \"timezone_name\": \"America/Bogota\",\n  \"locale\": \"es_CO\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/identity/users/auth/register/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', data.access || '');",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', data.refresh || '');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "description": "Acepta email o username en el campo username. Guarda tokens automaticamente.",
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/identity/users/auth/login/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh",
          "request": {
            "description": "Renueva el access token usando el refresh guardado.",
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/identity/users/auth/refresh/"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Identity",
      "description": "Endpoints basicos del usuario autenticado. Sirven para validar que JWT, permisos y dashboard ya estan funcionando.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "description": "Perfil actual del usuario autenticado.",
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/identity/users/me/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Dashboard",
          "request": {
            "description": "Vista agregada del usuario con snapshots y proyecciones.",
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/identity/users/dashboard/"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Accounts",
      "description": "Primero crea una cuenta. Ese request guarda account_id y habilita el resto del flujo financiero.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Accounts",
          "request": {
            "description": "Lista las cuentas visibles para el usuario autenticado.",
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/finance/accounts/cuentas/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Account",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('account_id', data.id || '');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "description": "Crea una cuenta simple para pruebas y guarda su id en la variable account_id.",
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Cuenta Postman\",\n  \"currency\": \"COP\",\n  \"type\": \"cash\",\n  \"ownership\": \"owned\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/finance/accounts/cuentas/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Account Memberships",
          "request": {
            "description": "Útil para revisar colaboración o cuentas compartidas.",
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/finance/accounts/membresias-cuenta/"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 - Transactions",
      "description": "Ciclo basico del ledger. Este bloque valida que el backend contable ya responde y que la cuenta creada arriba funciona.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Transactions",
          "request": {
            "description": "Lista el ledger actual del usuario.",
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/finance/transactions/transactions/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Transaction",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('transaction_id', data.id || '');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "description": "Crea una transaccion manual y guarda transaction_id. Requiere que account_id ya exista.",
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"account\": {{account_id}},\n  \"type\": \"expense\",\n  \"status\": \"posted\",\n  \"amount\": \"25000.00\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-04-06\",\n  \"notes\": \"Prueba desde Postman\",\n  \"confirmed\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/finance/transactions/transactions/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirm Transaction",
          "request": {
            "description": "Confirma una transaccion existente. Si ya está confirmada, el backend responderá sin mayor cambio.",
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/finance/transactions/transactions/{{transaction_id}}/marcar_confirmada/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Voice Inference Request",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201 || pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const req = data.inference_request || {};",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('inference_request_id', req.id || '');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "description": "Crea una solicitud asincronica de voz. El endpoint publico solo acepta referencia y metadatos del audio; la inferencia estructurada la produce el worker interno.",
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Request-Id", "value": "postman-voice-request-001" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "postman-voice-request-001" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"account_id\": {{account_id}},\n  \"audio_object_ref\": \"gs://vexxo-local-demo/audio/postman-voice-001.m4a\",\n  \"audio_content_type\": \"audio/mp4\",\n  \"audio_duration_ms\": 8400,\n  \"language\": \"es-CO\",\n  \"provider\": \"voice_ai\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/finance/transactions/inference-requests/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Voice Inference Requests",
          "request": {
            "description": "Lista solicitudes de inferencia transaccional visibles para el usuario.",
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/finance/transactions/inference-requests/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Retry Voice Inference Request",
          "request": {
            "description": "Reintenta una solicitud fallida o dead_letter.",
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/finance/transactions/inference-requests/{{inference_request_id}}/retry/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reject Inferred Transaction",
          "request": {
            "description": "Rechaza un borrador inferido pendiente sin usar PATCH ambiguo.",
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"No corresponde a un gasto real\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/finance/transactions/transactions/{{transaction_id}}/rechazar_inferida/"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 - Payments",
      "description": "Pruebas del bounded context de pagos. No todo terminará en un cobro real, pero sí sirve para validar pricing, creación de intents y artefactos operativos.",
      "item": [
